  - m_Id: 624824881152
    m_Localized: "Hedef:\nT\xFCm Y\u0131ld\u0131zlar\u0131 Topla!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 678042210304
    m_Localized: "Kontroller:\nZ\u0131plama : bo\u015Fluk ya da yukar\u0131 tu\u015Fu\nHareket
      : a,s,d,w ya da y\xF6n tu\u015Flar\u0131\nMen\xFC: ESC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 699496075264
    m_Localized: "F tu\u015Funa bas ve d\xFC\u015Fmanlara ate\u015F et!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 726557724672
    m_Localized: "T\u0131rmanmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131n. Oyunun devam\u0131 i\xE7in
      bunu bilmeniz gerekiyor.\nBu kombinasyonlar\u0131 h\u0131zl\u0131ca deneyin:\nz\u0131pla
      - duvara tutun - duvardan \xE7ekil ve tekrar z\u0131pla - tekrar et"
